From: Arian <arian@kulmer.hu>
Subject: Write and publish parallel shots directly

For parallel captures the save path skips both the direct write and
the IS_PENDING reset and expects the MIUI gallery (com.miui.gallery)
to pull the bytes through ParallelProcessProvider and publish the
item later. Without that gallery installed, shots stay pending until
the next camera start recovers them.

Make the never-taken-branch trick explicit: run the direct write and
the publish update for parallel shots too.

---
